# How to apply partner developer account

If you are a partner (client) who wants to integrate Institutional Crypto Buy/Sell Solution’s Open API. Please contact CaaS Team and provide the following items:

- [Public key](https://developers.binance.com/en/docs/products/institutional-buy-sell/basics/3.request-signing) for API requests (private key kept by the partner/client safely);
- IP addresses used to config whitelist;
- Webhook callback url;

Once Institutional Crypto Buy/Sell Solution receives these items and completes the configuration, Institutional Crypto Buy/Sell Solution will provide the following items to the partner (client):

- Client id;
- Sign access token;
- Public key and partner code for webhook (private key kept by Institutional Crypto Buy/Sell Solution safely);

Then the partner (client) will be able to call all Open APIs.

> **Regarding different environments, please refer to “[Environments and API base URLs](https://developers.binance.com/en/docs/products/institutional-buy-sell/basics/4.base-urls)”. It's recommended to start with the QA environment first.*

